; Script: controls screen background and "Enter to menu"
;
; Interpreted by #R$9D5F: $8F y,x,width,height,attribute fills a block of attributes; $81 y,x,width,height,value fills
; a block of the bitmap (y in pixel rows, x and width in bytes); $8E y,x sets the text cursor (pixel rows and columns)
; and the characters that follow are printed; $80 ends. Here: all attributes to 0 (black), a clear block of the bitmap
; 64 rows high from row $40 (the middle third), the text, and the middle third of the attributes set to 7 (white on
; black).
@label=ScriptControlsScreen
t$A493 DEFB $8F,$00,$00,$20,$18,$00; attributes: whole screen black
 $A499 DEFB $81,$40,$00,$20,$40,$00; bitmap: clear rows $40-$7F
 $A49F DEFB $8E,$70,$4B; text at y = $70, x = $4B
 $A4A2 DEFM "Enter to menu"
 $A4AF DEFB $8F,$08,$00,$20,$08,$07; attributes: rows 8-15 white on black
 $A4B5 DEFB $80      ; end
